e_id":"v3feat_004_s3","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"The dataset was split into 80 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s4","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"Figure 1 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s5","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"From epoch 6 to epoch 9, the F1 score of EfficientNet improves by a relative 1.5%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s6","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"From epoch 1 to epoch 2, the F1 score of EfficientNet improves by a relative 12.0% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s7","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"From epoch 1 to epoch 9, the F1 score of EfficientNet improves by a relative 60.2% (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s8","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"At epoch 9, the loss of EfficientNet is 0.460.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s9","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"Figure 2 shows the results of this experiment.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1","figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s10","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"At epoch 4, the loss of ResNet-18 is about 1.3.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s11","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"The loss of ResNet-18 reaches its highest value of 2.194 at epoch 2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"v3feat_004_s12","report_id":"v3feat_004","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null,"figure_id":null}]}